OL,5,G0100 Pure Spice with DJ Manara
OL,6,     FDJ Manara keeps you guessing for
OL,7,     Fthree hours, switching between
OL,8,     Fgenres, eras and moods without
OL,9,     Fmissing a beat. Smooth mixes, mad
OL,10,     Fblends and plenty of surprises.
OL,11,G0400 Pure Spice - Takeover
OL,12,     FDJ HV is in the mix again for yet
OL,13,     Fanother big Pure Spice Takeover!
OL,14,     FThis week he heads over to Canada
OL,15,     Fto salute Drake and his
OL,16,     Fcontributions to the rap game for
OL,17,     Fover a decade!
